('Chunhong Park', 'OB', 'free', '[일상] 아래와 같은 메일이 왔기에 관심있으신 분들은 고고! This is International center…', '아래와 같은 메일이 왔기에 관심있으신 분들은 고고! This is International center advising room and the students committee of the students symposium 2013. We would like to announce that the registration for the students symposium is now open. The 3rd Multi-Disciplinary Students Symposium organized by international students and Japanese students will be held on March 2nd(Sat.). All Todai students and postdocs are welcome to join. It will be a good chance to meet new people, exchange ideas and introduce what you study. Application deadline is Feb. 10th. Special workshop on presentation skill is also provided for free before the symposium(Feb.21st 12:00-14:00) to make your presentation more attractive one. Professor Rab Paterson, who has lecture on presentation at Graduate school of Interdisciplinary Study will help us to learn better presentation skill. - Symposium : March 2nd(Sat.) on Hongo campus (Engineering building number 2) - Workshop on presentation skill: Feb. 21st(Thursday) (International center ) - Please check more details on the website website: http://collaborativesymposium.web.fc2.com/ facebook: https://www.facebook.com/events/119605861544109/-Inquiries: students symposium -Inquiries: Students committee < studentsympo2012@gmail.com > International center advising room 03-5841-2360 国際センター相談室＊学生合同シンポジウム運営委員会からのお知らせです。 第三回　学生合同シンポジウム　The 3rd Multi-Disciplinary Students Symposium　を、３月２日（土）に 開催します。東大の学生・ポスドク研究員なら、どなたでも発表・参加可能な学生主体のイベントです。 今年度は、専門・国を超え、お互いの研究内容を魅力的に相手に伝えることができるように、シンポジウムの２週間前(2月21日12時～14時）に、 プレゼンテーションについての授業を学際情報学環でお持ちの、Rab Paterson先生を迎えて、プレゼンテーションスキルアップのワ ークショップも実施します。 英語でのプレゼンテーションの仕方や、効果的なパワーポイントの使い方がわからない・・という学生もぜひワークショップに参加の上、 シンポジウムに挑戦してください。 分野を超えた東大の学生に出会い、自分の研究についての知見を深め、人に伝える・伝わることの楽しさを体験しましょう！ 参加だけの方も、事前登録が必要です。(締切2月10日） 詳細・登録は以下のウェブサイトから。　情報共有のためのfacebook も開設中です。 -Please check more details on the website facebook: https://www.facebook.com/events/119605861544109/ website: http://collaborativesymposium.web.fc2.com/ -問い合わせ: students symposium committee < studentsympo2012@gmail.com > 国際センター相談室 03-5841-2360
아래와 같은 메일이 왔기에 관심있으신 분들은 고고!
This is International center advising room and the students committee of the students symposium 2013. We would like to announce that the registration for the students symposium is now open.
The 3rd Multi-Disciplinary Students Symposium organized by international students and Japanese students will be held on March 2nd(Sat.).
All Todai students and postdocs are welcome to join.

