('전일', 'OB', 'free', '[일상] Postdoc wanted] 가까운 지인의 부탁을 받고 올립니다. A postdoctoral…', '[Postdoc wanted] 가까운 지인의 부탁을 받고 올립니다. A postdoctoral position at the computational materials group of Sergei Manzhos at the National University of Singapore https://sites.google.com/site/sergeimanzhos/ Project: ab initio modelling of fullerene-based materials for solar cells. Expected starting date: May 1, 2016 Job requirements: Hard requirements: competence and proven track record in - ab initio modeling at the DFT level of molecular and periodic systems. - undestanding of the physics of organic solar cells. - technical writing in English. The following are desired but not indispensible qualifications: - experience with molecular dynamics, either AIMD or with force fields. - experience in calculating conductance in organic materials or charge transfer rates. - experience with the density functional tight binding method. The post is available for initial 1 year + 1 year on mutual agreement. The salary will be at least SGD50,000 per year or more depending on competence. Health benefits are provided. Very little tax will be incurred ( https://www.iras.gov.sg/…/Working-Out-You…/Income-Tax-Rates/ ) Direct queries by email to mpemanzh@nus.edu.sg
